@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="container-intro">
    <div>
        <h1>Your Collection, Curated.</h1>
        <p>Meticulously organize, deeply analyze, and elegantly showcase your artisanal scent vault. A sanctuary for the discerning collector.</p>
        <button class="btn-secondary"> START YOUR VALUE </button>
    </div>
    <div>
        <img src="/images/sample-images/minimal-perfume.png"
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-experience">
    <div>
        <p>THE EXPERIENCE</p>
        <h2>Elevating the Ritual</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-features">
        <div>
            <h3>Digital Shelf</h3>
            <p>Visualize your entire collection through apristine glassmorphic gallery. Sort by season, perfumer, or olfactory family with seamless grace.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3>Performance Tracking</h3>
            <p>Log longevity, projection, and sillage metrics for every wear. Understand how atmospheric conditions affect your signature scents.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3>Usage Analytics</h3>
            <p>Discover your true preferences. Elegant data visualizations reveal your most worn notes and temporal wearing habits.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-analytics">
    <div>
        <img src="/images/sample-images/perfume.png" />
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Analytical Elegance</h2>
        <p>Every bottle holds a story. Capture the nuances of each
wearing experience with refined metrics that respect the
artisanal craft of perfumery.</p>
    <button class="btn-secondary"> EXPLORE THE METRICS </button>
    </div>
    
</div>